{"id":"df2d2e0aeba68c37","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-comb-nonreflecting-stationary-set.md","title":"ZFC Comb Nonreflecting Stationary Set","display":"df-zfc-comb-nonreflecting-stationary-set — ZFC Comb Nonreflecting Stationary Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb-nonreflecting-stationary-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb-nonreflecting-stationary-set"],"display":"df-zfc-comb-nonreflecting-stationary-set — ZFC Comb Nonreflecting Stationary Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-stationary]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]","[[58-df-zfc-club-subset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb-nonreflecting-stationary-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb-nonreflecting-stationary-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb-nonreflecting-stationary-set — ZFC Comb Nonreflecting Stationary Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"58-df-stationary\">58-df-stationary</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3343ee70542e7296\" href=\"?note=3343ee70542e7296\" title=\"58-df-zfc-club-subset\">58-df-zfc-club-subset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(S\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span> (stationary set candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (ambient regular cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stationary}\">\\(\\operatorname{Stationary}\\)</span> (stationarity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"58-df-stationary\">58-df-stationary</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}\\)</span> (cofinality operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S\\)</span> (club-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3343ee70542e7296\" href=\"?note=3343ee70542e7296\" title=\"58-df-zfc-club-subset\">58-df-zfc-club-subset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCombNonreflectingStationarySet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCombNonreflectingStationarySet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}nonreflecting\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombNonreflectingStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)&gt;\\omega\\to\\exists C\\subseteq\\alpha\\;(\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(C,\\alpha)\\land S\\cap\\alpha\\cap C=\\emptyset)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}nonreflecting\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombNonreflectingStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)&gt;\\omega\\to\\exists C\\subseteq\\alpha\\;(\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(C,\\alpha)\\land S\\cap\\alpha\\cap C=\\emptyset)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Nonreflection is expanded as the existence of a club in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> disjoint from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\cap\\alpha\">\\(S\\cap\\alpha\\)</span>; this avoids applying the regular-cardinal stationarity predicate to an arbitrary reflection point.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stationary","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-stationary]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-club-subset","status":"resolved","id":"3343ee70542e7296","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-club-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stationary","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Stationary}$ (stationarity predicate, see [[58-df-stationary]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{cf}$ (cofinality operation, see [[58-df-cofinality]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-club-subset","status":"resolved","id":"3343ee70542e7296","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S$ (club-subset predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-club-subset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Stationary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCombNonreflectingStationarySet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}nonreflecting\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombNonreflectingStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\omega<\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)>\\omega\\to\\exists C\\subseteq\\alpha\\;(\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(C,\\alpha)\\land S\\cap\\alpha\\cap C=\\emptyset)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"S\\cap\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1490,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1643","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-comb-nonreflecting-stationary-set.md|58-df-zfc-comb-nonreflecting-stationary-set]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b802c3dd76418d95","315ad00b8744fdfc","3343ee70542e7296"]}